  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 Adaptation - Samoa Program Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment supported the reshaping of Australia&apos;s bilateral development support to Samoa to reflect COVID-19 priorities. This included technical assistance through a Strategic Program Advisor to include COVID-19 measures into the Samoa development program, aligned with the strategic development priorities for both Australia and Samoa., The investment included support for monitoring and evaluation of activities, and program quality assurance.</narrative>
  </description>
